Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790600399999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790553599999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Two long-duration two-sided ranges (bars 8-32 and 84-107) dominate much of the window, with heavy overlap.", "The immediate six bars (115-120) are a tight sideways group with upper wicks (bar 116 high 2786.81), a stall rather than fresh breakout.", "The window opens with a bear spike, so the 120-bar span is not uniformly bullish.", "Number of overlapping and doji-like bars in the middle reflects two-sided trade rather than a clean one-way trend throughout."], "evidence_for": ["Sequence of higher swing highs and higher lows from the 1368.42 low (bar 7) through the 2850 high (bar 114).", "The recent 2850 high exceeds the 2680 spike and the 2357-2557 range top, showing acceptance above prior consolidation.", "Several strong bull trend bars with wide range and close near high (bars 81, 82, 83, 104, 111, 114).", "Price holds well above the 1821-1974 range that contained bars 54-80, and the last consolidation sits high in the window."], "missing_information": ["No pre-window bars, so whether 1368.42 or 2850 marks a major higher-timeframe swing level is unknown.", "No volume profile or order-flow context; only closed OHLC bars are available.", "No declared reference levels from outside the supplied 120-bar window."], "observations": ["120-bar D1 window opens near 2006 and sells off in seven consecutive lower bars to a 1368.42 low, a climax bear spike of roughly one-third.", "Bars 8-32 form a two-sided base between 1512.91 and 1845.09 with heavy overlap, doji-like bars, and no sustained directional follow-through.", "Bars 33-53 lift with higher swing highs and higher lows from 1597.72 to 1954.36, a bull leg punctuated by short two- to four-bar pullbacks.", "Bars 54-80 return to a broad two-sided range roughly 1821.49-1974.46, so much of the middle of the window is range rather than one-way trend.", "Bar 81 is an explosive bull trend bar (open 1916.51, close 2252.16) that begins an approximately three-bar bull spike to a 2771 high.", "Bars 84-107 consolidate in a broad range around 2357.18-2557.46, including a single spike high of 2680 at bar 104 that is not held.", "Bars 108-114 break above that range to a new window high of 2850, with large bull bars at bars 111 and 114.", "Bars 115-120 form a tight consolidation between 2633.31 and 2786.81 with clustered closes near 2685-2695, a pause just below the 2850 high.", "Final-third closes sit in the upper portion of the window's overall range, consistent with higher lows and higher highs since the bar-7 low."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear spike: seven consecutive lower bars from a 2035.94 high to a 1368.42 low with large bear ranges and closes near the low.", "end_time_ms": 1780703999999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780185600000, "upper_boundary": "2035.94"}, {"description": "Two-sided base after the sell-off; overlapping bars and repeated tests between the 1512.91 low and the 1845.09 spike high of bar 16.", "end_time_ms": 1782950399999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780704000000, "upper_boundary": "1845.09"}, {"description": "Bull leg with higher highs and higher lows from 1597.72 to 1954.36, interrupted by tight pullbacks.", "end_time_ms": 1784851199999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "1597.72", "start_time_ms": 1782950400000, "upper_boundary": "1954.36"}, {"description": "Broad two-sided range roughly 1821.49-1974.46 that overlaps the prior bull leg, containing many doji and overlapping bars.", "end_time_ms": 1787183999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1821.49", "start_time_ms": 1784851200000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Explosive three-bar bull spike out of the prior range, led by the very large bar 81; high reaches 2771.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Broad consolidation around 2357.18-2557.46 after the spike; a lone spike high of 2680 at bar 104 is rejected and price falls back inside.", "end_time_ms": 1789343999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Bull leg breaking above the prior range to a new window high of 2850, with large bull bars at bars 111 and 114.", "end_time_ms": 1790035199999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789430400000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Tight six-bar consolidation below the 2850 high between 2633.31 and 2786.81, with clustered closes and an upper-wick bar 116.", "end_time_ms": 1790553599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Sustained closes back inside the 2357.18-2557.46 range would move the read back toward trading-range.", "A close below the 2633.31 consolidation low would deepen the pullback and weaken the channel reading.", "A decisive break and hold above 2850 with follow-through would reinforce the bull-trend and channel classification.", "A close below the 1905.63 spike low area would negate the bull breakout and shift toward transition-unclear."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790596799999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["~40 bars since the 2850 high are two-sided and overlapping - range behavior rather than trend.", "The pullback retraced roughly 44% of the 2358.62 to 2850 leg (down to 2633.31), deeper than a typical shallow trend pullback.", "The 2648.49 pullback low was undercut by 2636.28, weakening the higher-low structure that defined the bull leg.", "The 2850 bar's large upper tail and the subsequent stall raise the possibility of a buy climax and a transition to a trading range.", "Recent bars show lower highs (2740.42 vs 2850) with flat-to-slightly-lower lows."], "evidence_for": ["Sustained higher-high/higher-low sequence from 2358.62 to 2850 across ~35 bars with only shallow pullbacks.", "Price holds far above the bull-leg low (2358.62) and above the 2568.16 pullback low (bar 71).", "Window is net positive and printed a new high at 2850, i.e., acceptance at higher prices.", "The consolidation sits at the top of the up-move, which is characteristic of a bull-trend pause/pullback rather than a breakdown."], "missing_information": ["Only closed OHLCV bars are supplied; no order-flow, delta, or volume-at-price data.", "No bars after the decision time, so follow-through from the current tight range is unknown.", "Higher-timeframe (D1) context outside this 120-bar window is not assessed."], "observations": ["120 H4 bars; net change from open 2473.36 to close 2667.86 (about +194). Window high 2850 (bar 78); window low 2358.62 (bar 43).", "Opening ~43 bars are mostly two-sided between roughly 2411 and 2520, including a bull spike to 2680 (bar 18) that sold straight back off.", "From the 2358.62 low (bar 43) price rallied roughly 35 bars in a sequence of higher highs and higher lows - 2481.66, 2519.81, 2585.5, 2643.52, 2700, 2850 - with only short 1-3 bar pullbacks.", "Bar 78 (open 2658.81, high 2850, close 2723.15) is a large bull bar with a ~127-point upper tail printed after acceleration, a candidate buy-climax/exhaustion bar.", "Since the 2850 high, ~40 bars are two-sided and heavily overlapping between about 2633.31 and 2804.59, with no sustained directional follow-through.", "The last ~20 bars compress into a tight band (about 2636-2717) with small bodies and declining volume (about 2-4M vs 8-10M earlier), a tight-range / breakout-mode state.", "The 2648.49 pullback low (bar 91) was marginally undercut by the latest low 2636.28 (bar 119), so the bull-leg higher-low sequence is no longer clean.", "Price now sits near the middle of the post-peak range, below the 2850 peak and far above the 2358.62 low."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bull leg from the 2358.62 swing low (bar 43) to the 2850 high (bar 78): a run of higher highs and higher lows (2481.66, 2519.81, 2585.5, 2643.52, 2700, 2850) with short 1-3 bar pullbacks and moderate overlap, resembling a bull channel.", "end_time_ms": 1789992000000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Accelerated bull bar (bar 78, open 2658.81, high 2850, close 2723.15) with a large upper tail after several accelerating bars; candidate buy-climax/exhaustion that immediately preceded the stall.", "end_time_ms": 1789992000000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": null, "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Post-peak consolidation: about 40 bars two-sided between 2633.31 and 2804.59, with the most recent ~20 bars compressed further into roughly 2636-2717 on declining volume.", "end_time_ms": 1790596799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Opening ~42 bars are mostly two-sided/overlapping: drift 2440-2520, a failed spike to 2680 (bar 18), then a slide to the 2358.62 low (bar 43).", "end_time_ms": 1789488000000, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1788868800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["A close a